    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- ATK & DEF 200%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Chance of performing a critical hit & damage reduction rate 17%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Receives an additional Ki +2 per Rainbow Ki Sphere obtained\n*Per \"Androids\", \"Target: Goku\" or \"GT Bosses\" Category ally\nattacking in the same turn (depending on which Category has\nmore members)*\n- ATK & DEF 50%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*When there is another \"Androids\" or \"Target: Goku\" Category ally\nattacking in the same turn*\n- Randomly changes Ki Spheres of a certain Type (TEQ excluded)\nto Rainbow Ki Spheres\n- DEF 170%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Damage reduction rate 17%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*For every Rainbow Ki Sphere obtained*\n- Launches an additional attack that has a great chance of becoming\na Super Attack (up to 2 times)\n*When activating the Active Skill or when attacking with 17 or more Ki*\n- ATK & DEF 70%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Chance of performing a critical hit 17%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*When receiving an attack*\n- DEF 100%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Damage reduction rate 17%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*For every attack received*\n- {passiveImg:forever}Ki +1 (up to +7)\n- {passiveImg:forever}ATK, DEF & chance of performing a critical hit 10%{passiveImg:up_g}\n(up to 70%)",
